stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> quiet

    quiet --> notice: R >= 0.20
    notice --> warning: R >= 0.45<br/>and coercion
    warning --> critical: R >= 0.70<br/>and hard gate
    quiet --> critical: caller asks for an OTP<br/>after authority or coercion
    critical --> recovery: user reads out a code

    critical --> warning: R < 0.60 for 30 s<br/>(threshold-based critical only)
    warning --> notice: R < 0.35 for 30 s
    notice --> quiet: R < 0.10 for 30 s

    recovery: critical_recovery

    note right of critical
        Hard gate: every required step of the attack chain,
        screen activity matching its objective, and speech
        addressed to the user. A critical raised by the OTP
        rules holds until the session ends.
    end note
